What is count?
String s = "banana";
int count = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++)
  if (s.substring(i, i + 1).equals("a")) count++;

What is result?
String s = "banana";
String result = "";
for (int i = s.length() - 1; i >= 0; i--)
  result += s.substring(i, i + 1);

What is result?
